.TH TIMERC-INSIGHTS 1 "2026" "timerc 1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
timerc-insights \- statistics and session log for timerc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B timerc insights
.br
.B timerc stats
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows what the local session database
(\fI~/.config/timerc/data.db\fR) knows: totals, completed versus stopped timers,
focused versus planned time, a per-day chart, an hour-of-day heatmap, the
sessions of a chosen day and the event log of the selected session.
.PP
On a terminal it opens a full-screen UI (also reachable as screen 2 of
.BR "timerc config" ).
When output is not a terminal it prints a plain-text summary of all time and of
today instead.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.BR Left / Right ", " h / l
Previous / next day.
.TP
.B t
Jump to today.
.TP
.BR Up / Down ", " j / k
Select a session.
.TP
.B PgUp / PgDn
Scroll its events.
.TP
.B r
Reload.
.TP
.B 1 2 3 4
Switch to Settings, Insights, Test or About.
.TP
.B q, Esc, Ctrl+C
Quit.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/timerc/data.db
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timerc (1),
.BR timerc-config (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mohamad Almousli <https://al-mo.de>
